            "description": "Zorse is a system for efficient LLM training on heterogeneous GPU clusters. It uses Pipeline-Efficient ZeRO DP, a novel integration of pipeline parallelism and data parallelism that is both communication- and memory-efficient. Grolar includes a planner that automatically finds optimized training configurations from the vast search space on heterogeneous clusters, achieving up to 3x higher training throughput than state-of-the-art systems. This Trovi artifact demonstrates running Zorse on a Chameleon Cloud bare-metal V100 node, walking through profiling, planning, and training end-to-end.",
